{"id":"n58145-1-7","stage":0,"title":"씨 · 用于称呼或指称前面的人","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n58145-1-7-1","ko":"김 씨가 일을 그만두었다면서요?","zh":"听说金先生辞职了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"김","meaning":"金（姓氏）","explanation":"김：金（姓氏）。","readings":[{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"김","audio":"/audio/a0d5f241aa6fb544e5d2.mp3"}},{"text":"씨가","meaning":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","explanation":"씨：用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"씨","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58145","senseId":"1","lemma":"씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"씨가","audio":"/audio/a79ea387c9969a8c754c.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"그만두었다면서요?","meaning":"停住，停","explanation":"그만두다：停住，停；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；다면서：引用所听到的话，向对方确认，非敬语；요：增加礼貌语气。","readings":[{"term":"그만두다","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62318","senseId":"1","lemma":"그만두다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그만두었다면서요","audio":"/audio/2958d6bce740cbcc6180.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"c90eea3c6347f1e0","term":"씨","zh":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","audio":"/audio/c90eea3c6347f1e0f4d9.mp3","entryId":"58145","definition":"用于称呼或指称前面的人，表示尊敬。","pronunciation":["씨"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"55dca49e4d54e352","term":"그만두다","zh":"停住，停","audio":"/audio/55dca49e4d54e352750e.mp3","entryId":"62318","definition":"停住正在做的事，不再进行。","pronunciation":["그만두다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a65b59e2ffb3a8782f6a.